<title>UK: Nat'l Bank of Canada sets $300 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Nat'l Bank of Canada sets $300 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Sanwa International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL BANK OF CANADA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.985    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    QUBE/CAN  HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
